  "title": "AGTTM Part 6 - Field Staff Implementation",
  "abstract": "AGTTM Part 6 provides practical implementation guidance for field personnel responsible for traffic management at roadwork sites. This guide translates technical requirements from AGTTM Parts 1-5 into operational on-site procedures, serving as a field-ready reference for traffic controllers, site supervisors, and work crews. The document covers essential field operations including pre-start safety checks, equipment inspection protocols, signage installation sequences, ongoing site monitoring requirements, and pack-down procedures. It provides step-by-step guidance for common traffic management tasks and decision-making frameworks for handling unexpected situations.",
